Z||000006||Cliff Pennock||07-01-2000||09:46 PM||||Ah, I forgot to mention a few other things...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>This is your original code<P><BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, lucidatypewriter">code:</font><HR><pre><BR>function chgIn (num) {<P>  if (num==4){<BR>    <BR>    document.screen.src = "images/screen"+num+".jpg"};<BR>  else {<BR>    setTimeout("i"+num+".src='images/image"+num+"_on.jpg'",100)<BR>    document.screen.src = "images/screen"+num+".jpg"};<P>};</pre><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Change it to:<P><BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, lucidatypewriter">code:</font><HR><pre><BR>function chgIn (num) {<P>  if (num==4){<BR>    <BR>    document.screen.src = "images/screen"+num+".jpg";<BR> } else {<BR>    setTimeout("i"+num+".src='images/image"+num+"_on.jpg'",100)<BR>    document.screen.src = "images/screen"+num+".jpg";<BR>}<BR>};</pre><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I've moved the brackets around a bit...||||reg||1
